"Entertainment?" Arraka says. "This is what I live for, Barry-boy."

"You lost your mind centuries ago," I say.

"Either that, or I'm the only sane entity in existence and the rest of you are delusional," she shoots back.

In the street, Eiden reads Daren's aura reset for the second time.

